    <note date="2026-10-09">Closed. Owner-approved release: Assemble added EntityKey contact.sprk_externalobjectiduniquekey to SpaarkeMaster in spaarkedev1 (1.2.0.0 -> 1.2.1.0); Export; PR #1518 merged; publish-dataverse-solutions-manifest.yml dry run then publish=true (run 37969187349) — dataverse-solutions-latest.json names 1.2.1.0. KeyAwaitingExport pin removed; the key is required by ContactIdentityBindingSchemaPackagedTests.</note>
